BlastIRC original cinematic sound set

boom.ogg, rumble.ogg, ding.ogg, blip.ogg, tick.ogg, whoosh.ogg,
click.ogg, pop.ogg, hush.ogg, and power_down.ogg were synthesized for
BlastIRC by assets/generate-sfx.mjs. They contain no samples, recordings,
melodies, or other material from third parties.

